    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexitten is a sci-fi roguelike deck builder with tactical grid based battles. You will build an elite team of heroes to tackle the greatest threats to the galactic alliance. During your campaign, you will travel through the 6 hextants of the galaxy to collect new abilities, modify your ships, recruit additional team members, discover each hero's story and increase their synergy with other heroes, encounter special events, and fight for the future of the alliance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >21 Heroes with 16 Guest Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >186 Ability Cards and 46 Hero/Guest/Boss Ability Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Tactical Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Addition Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Main Story Campaigns - Vortigon, StarNet, and Civil War</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >98 Ship Mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Progression - Unlock Heroes &amp; Cards &amp; Ship Mods, Level Up Heroes, Increase Synergy Level between Heroes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexitten is a sci-fi roguelike deck builder with tactical grid based battles. You will build an elite team of heroes to tackle the greatest threats to the galactic alliance. During your campaign, you will travel through the 6 hextants of the galaxy to collect new abilities, modify your ships, recruit additional team members, discover each hero's story and increase their synergy with other heroes, encounter special events, and fight for the future of the alliance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >21 Heroes with 16 Guest Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/e86ef8d0f463c3e693a2fc6ec8ac8829.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >186 Ability Cards and 46 Hero/Guest/Boss Ability Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/0a2b258fdb0c78e55cdd071b356dc7ee.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Tactical Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.poster.avif?t=1750418487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.webm?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670600/extras/6f28ea941e0ea71df9dff86be10948c9.mp4?t=1750418487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Addition Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Main Story Campaigns - Vortigon, StarNet, and Civil War</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >98 Ship Mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Progression - Unlock Heroes &amp; Cards &amp; Ship Mods, Level Up Heroes, Increase Synergy Level between Heroes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
